{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eiMQRQ7tcC1795661997.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔宏福苑火災一周年，有市民到場獻花悼念。<br/></p><p>有市民早上到宏福苑對出的廣福休憩處獻花悼念，長椅上擺放不同鮮花，亦有市民帶同糕點拜祭，附近有民安隊員駐守。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TAIPO-1000_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BZlr9ABj461795662008.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>宏福苑宏昌閣在去年11月26日，下午近三時起火，當時屋苑正進行大維修，火勢沿外圍非阻燃棚網等物料，迅速蔓延至另外六座，火警持續43小時，最終造成168人死亡。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:00:05.399852+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T04:13:43.194870+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:53:28.955701+00:00","content_hash":"44aede7e61a87a9fffb4df57cdceb4a0f94aed781103d1eaa974ef2701692938","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:00:05.399852+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}